# Every tracked file in this repository is text (verified 2026-08-24 — no
# binary file is tracked). Normalize line endings to LF in the repository
# regardless of what a given checkout's `core.autocrlf` does locally: CI's
# drift checks (`npm run graph -- --check`, `npm run openapi -- --check`)
# compare committed bytes, and `core.autocrlf=true` plus no .gitattributes
# meant that guarantee was accidental rather than enforced — see
# DECISION_LOG.md 2026-08-24.
* text=auto eol=lf
